#
# The TEMPLATE below is copied BYTE-FOR-BYTE from the v1 (14B) Modelfile. The
# 8B base's own template in ollama differs from it only in the model name
# inside the fallback system prompt, a branch that fires only when no system
# message is sent (the triage path always sends one). Otherwise it must not
